    "tiers": null,
    "notes": "Hosted jobs each use a fresh VM. No documented simultaneous-VM cap for GitLab.com hosted runners. Documented GitLab.com limits: max jobs in active (created/pending/running) pipelines per project 500 Free / 1,000 trial / 20,000 Premium / 60,000 Ultimate; max jobs per pipeline 500/1,000/1,500/2,000; pipeline creation 25 per minute per project+commit+user; job timeout 3 h. macOS runs on limited AWS bare-metal capacity (extended queueing possible); Windows VMs take ~5 min to provision (pending time is not billed). When the monthly quota is used up, new jobs stop and running jobs are dropped after a 1,000-minute grace.",
    "sources": [
